{"id":"3c18697a66efe44c","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-consistent.md","title":"Consistent Boolean equation","display":"df-consistent — Consistent Boolean equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-consistent","aliases":["27-df-consistent"],"display":"df-consistent — Consistent Boolean equation","depends_on":["[[27-df-solution]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistent — Consistent Boolean equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed235bccfeff0bde\" href=\"?note=ed235bccfeff0bde\" title=\"27-df-solution\">27-df-solution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed235bccfeff0bde\" href=\"?note=ed235bccfeff0bde\" title=\"27-df-solution\">27-df-solution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\neq\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\neq\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This concerns solvability of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=0\">\\(f(x)=0\\)</span>, not satisfiability of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=1\">\\(f(x)=1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-solution","status":"resolved","id":"ed235bccfeff0bde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-solution]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-solution","status":"resolved","id":"ed235bccfeff0bde","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ and $\\mathrm{Sol}(f)$ (see [[27-df-solution]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sol}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sol}(f)\\neq\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"f(x)=0","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)=1","display":false}],"bytes":773,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-consistent|df-consistent — Consistent Boolean equation]]"},{"id":"d3ac68eea8338476","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsistentEq}$ (equation-consistency predicate, see [[27-df-consistent]])"}],"out